			"notes": "## What's Changed\n* Support older original Reliquary by @kuba6000 in https://github.com/kuba6000/Mobs-Info/pull/149\n* Fix crash with AoA and Et Futurum by @kuba6000 in https://github.com/kuba6000/Mobs-Info/pull/150\n* Limit first random generation by @kuba6000 in https://github.com/kuba6000/Mobs-Info/pull/151\n* Fix pokecube crash by @kuba6000 in https://github.com/kuba6000/Mobs-Info/pull/152\n* Skip malformed stacks in villager trades by @kuba6000 in https://github.com/kuba6000/Mobs-Info/pull/153\n* Check blacklist during generation by @kuba6000 in https://github.com/kuba6000/Mobs-Info/pull/154\n* Avoid double NEI handlers registration by @kuba6000 in https://github.com/kuba6000/Mobs-Info/pull/155\n* Support mine trading cards by @kuba6000 in https://github.com/kuba6000/Mobs-Info/pull/156\n* Add MineFantasy2 support and partial Loot++ support (singleplayer only) by @kuba6000 in https://github.com/kuba6000/Mobs-Info/pull/157\n* Add fishing handler to NEI by @kuba6000 in https://github.com/kuba6000/Mobs-Info/pull/158\n* Make drop generation smarter by @kuba6000 in https://github.com/kuba6000/Mobs-Info/pull/148\n* better unification blacklist check by @danyadev in https://github.com/kuba6000/Mobs-Info/pull/147\n* Improve performance and security in various components by @Spagles in https://github.com/kuba6000/Mobs-Info/pull/143\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/GTNewHorizons/Mobs-Info/compare/0.5.21-GTNH...0.6.0-GTNH"
